  "notes": "Datasheet SLVS044Z. TO-220 KCS/KCT is legacy-chip only, so legacy-chip rows of 6.6 are used where the table splits legacy/new chip (load regulation, temperature stability, ripple rejection); new-chip rows (load regulation 0.1/0.5 and 0.3/1.5 %VO, temperature stability 1%, PSRR 65 / 66-80 dB) are excluded. Load regulation legacy VO ≤ 5V @TJ=25°C shows only '25' positioned in the MAX column (typ blank) - stored as max. ADJUST has I/O '—' in the pin table; role FEEDBACK. OUTPUT is pin 2 and TAB. ABS_MAX TJ (legacy) printed −65..150. Thermal: KCS and KCT columns differ (23.5 vs 37.9 °C/W RθJA); other thermal rows given for KCS. No tabulated timing/dynamic specs (ripple rejection at 120Hz and RMS noise are not sequencing timing; load transient response only in typical figures 6-4..6-6; '20ms pulse' is a test condition of thermal regulation), so timing is empty. Text file contains control characters (binary) - read via cleaned copy / PyMuPDF words."
